  %h3 Internationalization
  %p
    We've worked with many families that are not native English speakers and
    we want to make Pick-a-Pic accessible to them as soon as we can. 
    Additional language support will be added as time and budget allow.

  %h3 Upcoming releases
  %p These are our planned updates to Pick-a-Pic.

  %h4: v1.1 Performance and stability improvements
  %dl
    %dd Concurrent picture creation
    %dt Improve the speed of bulk picture creation by splitting it into concurrent background tasks.
    %dd Handle downloading document
    %dt When a document is opened via iCloud before it is fully downloaded, display a progress meter that indicates download progress.
    %dd Handle empty document state
    %dt Investigate whether the app can be put into a state where no document is opened. If so, handle it gracefully.
    %dd Handle conflict document state
    %dt If two users have saved conflicting versions of a Pick-a-Pic document, display an interface for conflict resolution.
    %dd Improve state restoration
    %dt
      Define more
      %a{ href: "https://developer.apple.com/documentation/foundation/nsuseractivity", target: "_blank" } NSUserActivity
      \ objects so that app state can be restored in greater detail.
    %dd Reduce cache memory footprint
    %dt
      Move cached data from RAM to disk by using
      %a{ href: "https://developer.apple.com/documentation/foundation/urlcache", target: "_blank" } URLCache
      \ instead of
      %a{ href: "https://developer.apple.com/documentation/foundation/nscache", target: "_blank" } NSCache
      \ when possible.

  %h4: v1.2: Options for power users
  %dl
    %dd Bulk actions
    %dt Enable multiple pictures to be tagged or deleted at one time.
    %dd Bulk import
    %dt Allow multiple photos or files to be imported.
    %dd Tag on import
    %dt Allow tags to be selected that will be applied to all pictures as they are imported.
    %dd Duplicate book
    %dt Allow books to be copied, including to other Pick-a-Pic files.
    %dd Duplicate page or book
    %dt Allow pages to be copied, including to other books.
    %dd Import export book
    %dt Allow books to be exported and then imported into other Pick-a-Pic documents.
    %dd Import / export photo library
    %dt Allow the photo library to be exported and then imported into other Pick-a-Pic documents.

  %h4 v1.3: iPadOS integrations and conventions
  %p This release will implement the small details that make an app feel truly polished and iPad-like.
  %dl
    %dd Live document thumbnail
    %dt
      Implement
      %a{ href: "https://developer.apple.com/documentation/quicklookthumbnailing/qlthumbnailprovider", target: "_blank" } QLThumbnailProvider 
      to make Pick-a-Pic document file thumbnails display the cover of one of their books.
    %dd Keyboard shortcuts
    %dt Create keyboard shortcuts for common app actions, such as importing, renaming, deleting, or even scrolling through pages.
    %dd Add app to share sheets
    %dt
      Implement
      %a{ href: "https://developer.apple.com/documentation/social/slcomposeserviceviewcontroller", target: "_blank" } SLComposeServiceViewController
      to allow images to be imported as pictures through the system share sheet.
    %dd Rename document while in app
    %dt Allow the currently opened document to be renamed without exiting to the file picker.
  